msgid "9-slice scaling mode splits the selected texture in 9 sections (4 corners, 4 borders and 1 inner).\n						Corners are drawn as-is, Borders are repeated on the sides of the entity, and Inner is stretch at the center of the entity.\n						You can adjust the size of up, down, left and right borders, in pixels."
msgstr "9スライス（九分割）スケーリングモードは、選択したテクスチャを9つのセクション（4つの角、4つの辺、1つの内側）に分割します。\n角はそのまま描画され、辺はエンティティの側面に沿って繰り返され、内側は中央で引き伸ばされます。\n上下左右の境界サイズ（ピクセル単位）を調整できます。"

msgid "9-slice scaling mode splits the selected texture in 9 sections (4 corners, 4 borders and 1 inner).\nCorners are drawn as-is, Borders are repeated on the sides of the entity, and Inner is stretch at the center of the entity.\nYou can adjust the size of up, down, left and right borders, in pixels."
